have been able to see it.

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:09.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
It must be exciting
to finally have it available

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:12.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. It is.
It's kind of --

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.147 line:92%
