Oh, my God, what year is it?

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:25.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know, that happens.
-Oh, thank you.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:29.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, isn't that weird?
