00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.322 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:57.424 line:92%
-Yeah. It's a multiverse.

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
My life is
