00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:20.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
but we were happy to have
more time just to finish it.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then it was supposed t
come out in November,

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:24.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then that started
to look dicey.

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:29.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway, it's been long.
It's been very, very long.

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:31.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
